WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.938
Eight in the morning.

2
00:00:02.038 --> 00:00:04.933
Thirty-seven new messages arrived this week.

3
00:00:05.033 --> 00:00:08.739
Requests, invites, alerts, newsletters, all in one pile.

4
00:00:09.589 --> 00:00:11.290
Most of it is routine.

5
00:00:11.390 --> 00:00:15.800
Plain rules, your own Gmail searches, route twenty-seven messages.

6
00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:19.158
No AI is involved, and nothing is sent anywhere.

7
00:00:20.008 --> 00:00:22.263
Only ten need someone to read them.

8
00:00:22.363 --> 00:00:28.181
A small, cheap model, through the Copilot CLI or Claude Code, takes them in a single batch.

9
00:00:28.281 --> 00:00:33.310
The three it is unsure about go to a stronger model, with a short slice of the message.

10
00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:36.437
Then plain code checks every answer.

11
00:00:36.537 --> 00:00:39.432
The right messages, known labels, real dates.

12
00:00:39.532 --> 00:00:42.939
Anything else is refused before it touches your inbox.

13
00:00:43.789 --> 00:00:45.660
Every message gets a label.

14
00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:49.338
Four requests become Google Tasks, with their deadlines.

15
00:00:49.438 --> 00:00:52.035
Eleven finished messages are archived.

16
00:00:52.135 --> 00:00:57.228
And one, are you around on Friday, stays in your inbox, because no model was sure.

17
00:00:58.078 --> 00:01:00.291
At nine, the schedule runs again.

18
00:01:00.391 --> 00:01:03.201
Nothing new to read, so no model is called.

19
00:01:03.301 --> 00:01:05.364
Most hours cost nothing at all.

20
00:01:06.214 --> 00:01:08.320
Nothing moves without your say-so.

21
00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:12.617
Every change is a dry run first, written to a plan you can read.

22
00:01:12.717 --> 00:01:15.889
Applied changes are journalled, and you can undo them.

23
00:01:16.739 --> 00:01:18.397
AI Mail Assistant.

24
00:01:18.497 --> 00:01:20.966
Open source, for your Mac and Gmail.

25
00:01:21.066 --> 00:01:23.556
One command sets it up: make setup.

26
00:01:23.656 --> 00:01:25.442
Every message, routed.
